# Persistent Temporal dev-server SQLite DB written by the C-MSD integration tests
# (internal/testinfra/temporal.go). Left in place after a run so `make temporal-ui`
# can browse every test execution; never committed.
.temporal/

# Per-test Temporal workflow event-history JSON artifacts ("like playwright").
test-artifacts/

# Compiled server binary (build artifact, ~50MB). Build locally; never commit.
/server
/gen-uiprofiles
/gen-uitests-fixtures
/gen-uitests-episodes

# Compiled local-first CLI binaries (local-first-init-funnel Task 5,
# `go build ./cmd/archistrator` / `./cmd/server` with no -o land here).
/archistrator
/archistrator-server

# The state tool, as a bare `go build ./cmd/aiarch-state-mcp` in server/ lands it. It
# was once tracked and went stale (final review I5); the local rail now refuses a
# binary whose `version` is not the server's own (R56), so build it, never commit it.
/aiarch-state-mcp
